## Context

The published model-comparison scores contain tariff arithmetic errors. User decision: correct the maths, accept diagnostics and categories as is. Publication is explicitly deferred; this ticket is the handoff for a dated PS and updated artefacts.

## Frozen artefacts

Arena repository: ~/CNRS/code/arena
Bundle: archives/2026-10-13-arithmetic-correction/
Read README.md and verify SHA256SUMS.json before use. Corrected FR/EN PDFs, figures, paired comparisons, blog PS HTML, optional comment draft, frozen published snapshot, source hashes, correction audit and reproduction scripts are preserved together. Original published blog PDF remains identifiable; it has not been replaced.

## Impact

Qwen remains highest mean. Quality/cost Pareto frontier adds local Coder. Nominal quality comparison links: 12 -> 9; Holm-corrected links remain zero. Costs, times, diagnostic text and declared categories are unchanged. Do not extend this correction to substantive rejudging or mix in later tournament results.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Review and publish the dated PS plus numerical replacement passages on https://realf.hypotheses.org/386.
