- [ ] Regenerate the corrected blog PDF from the publication source (the saved blog-archived.pdf is the original).
- [ ] Publish corrected FR/EN report versions and blog PDF on the personal page / HAL as appropriate; preserve prior versions and clearly mark correction dates.
- [ ] Verify published figures, scores and links against the frozen bundle; record final URLs/version identifiers here.

